------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party material in the recorded corpus
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The fixtures under fixtures/ quote short passages of rule text from real public
repositories, and use label names from published benchmark datasets. Every such
source is listed with its URL and license in:

    fixtures/ATTRIBUTION.md

Summary of the licenses involved:

  Apache-2.0   supabase/supabase, cloudflare/workers-sdk, openai/codex,
               apache/airflow
  MIT          ghostty-org/ghostty, withastro/astro
  CC-BY-4.0    PolyAI/banking77
  CC-BY-3.0    clinc/clinc_oos (CLINC150)
  no license   nickbreaton/printable.photos — see the note in
               fixtures/ATTRIBUTION.md explaining why ~370 characters of its
               rule text are reproduced verbatim, and how to have it removed

Anthropic and TypeSafe product documentation is quoted in a small number of
fixtures under their own terms; those are commercial documents, not open-licensed
works, and are cited in the provenance field of each fixture that uses them.

If you are the author of anything listed in fixtures/ATTRIBUTION.md and would
prefer it not appear here, open an issue and it will be removed.
